The lawsuit said the devices sometimes switched themselves on by mistake — hearing a 'Hey Google' that nobody said — and recorded private conversations. Some of those recordings were then sent to outside contractors, who listened and typed out what they heard.

The case covered people who bought Google-made Assistant devices going back to 2016. Google denied wrongdoing, as companies usually do in a settlement.

Check your own Google account's Voice and Audio Activity setting — that is where recordings like these are saved.

Is there a smart speaker listening in your house right now?</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/aMwnSSm</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[TheRainbowegoSweet007]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Death just collects. Be patient.</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/4XPBuT5</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/Ip8DYih.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/4XPBuT5</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[jollyjack]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>A moderately sized DK dump of stolen memes for these trying times 2219.</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/5NZxcok</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/Qf6wbZf.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/z5gHe8t.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/tZeFmyd.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/CnKz0nd.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/zWvJqKL.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/OyUI6PT.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/Am2vdIV.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/mK359j5.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/lwQ8L3E.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ENggVjp.jpg" style="max-width: