v><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ViOEpkC.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I don’t know, I think it’s MORE disconcerting to see it in pink with the macabre around it, much like Umbridge</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/2LO9dms.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>The kids still try to kill each other though</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/5u1eTns.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Sweetest thing I’ve ever heard but also heartbreaking</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/vcxb6zm.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Yes, I love this idea</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/uEEJmeG.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I haven’t but it’s pretty obvious when you watch it as an adult</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/AdBlLe1.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I just thought she was funny. I wasn’t a kid who thought about how girls portrayed themselves too deeply.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/wsqCppI.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>It is a weird thing</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/iBvV3k9.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>And kinda cute</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/2y5Nx4W.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>But like, what’s she going to study? Maybe she’s going to witches college</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/eMAthHu.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I heard they can hold them for at least 17 years!</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/CXEJgsM.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Not sure I could handle the adoration but I’d be willing to try it</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ESJjW6H.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>He found a family</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/FeaxR9J.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>She did great. I think she’s great in everything though.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/LUKBk2v.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Their worst nightmare</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/ClyUZ23.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Pastel goth is a thing through</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/4xeatrb.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Didn’t they do this at the end of the first movie?</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/mBCOFZJ.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Truly evil</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/GWdLmEe.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Are they in dog cages?</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/VPzOTfb.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Looks like southern tornado weather to me</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/OfmmoqQ</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[GigglySprinkleCupcake]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>We'll allow it (with the accent)</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/vnIkbJA</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/DRGOAIb.gif" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/vnIkbJA</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[svardfiska]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>RIP Patrick Stewart</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/Jl6wKlc</link><description>